# Keep VCS data, editor, CI and agent files, Go workspace files, local
# databases, key material, encrypted data and build output out of the Docker
# build context, in the tool folders too. The static stage needs only the Go
# sources and go.mod files, and builds in module mode as CI does.
.git
**/.github
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/.junie
**/.devcontainer
**/.claude
**/CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.local.md
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.ckey
**/*.enc
**/pw.txt
**/*-pw.txt
**/coverage.*
**/*.out
**/*.test
**/*.sarif
**/bin
**/dist
**/*.exe
/capsus
/Munus/munus
/Salus/salus
go.work
go.work.sum
